{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12905","headline":"衮州送李明府使苏州便赴告期 · 韩翃","name":"衮州送李明府使苏州便赴告期","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫言水国去迢迢，白马吴门见不遥。\n枫树林中经楚雨，木兰舟上蹋江潮。\n空山古寺千年石，草色寒堤百尺桥。\n早晚卢家兰室在，珊瑚玉佩彻青霄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12905.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12905","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}